    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d670">

                <pb facs="0791" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg703"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The King of Portugal to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-11"><hi rendition="#italic">June 11,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Had to-day the great pleasure of proposing your health at luncheon on board the
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Kearsarge</hi>. American men-of-war are always
                    welcome in Portuguese waters.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">King of Portugal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
